# Spinneret and Spiderling: "Whenever you attack with two or more Spiders, put a +1/+1 counter on Spinneret and Spiderling.
# Whenever Spinneret and Spiderling deals 4 or more damage, exile the top card of your library. Until the end of your next
# turn, you may play that card." It attacks beside Masked Meower, exactly two Spiders, and takes a counter: with Rancor it is
# a 4/4 trampler. Blocked by Memnite, it deals 1 to the Memnite and 3 to Bot2 at once (CR 510.2): neither part is 4,
# but the total is, so the ability triggers once. The top card, Lightning Bolt, is exiled, and Bot1 casts it from exile.

